Блок 4 (bill_with_ipu) — исправляем соединение:

```sql
bill_with_ipu AS (
  SELECT
      b.clnt_clnt_id,
      b.subs_subs_id,
      b.srls_srls_id,
      b.PACK_PACK_ID,
      b.RTPL_RTPL_ID,
      NVL(sm.serv_parm, 0) AS serv_parm,
      b.AMOUNT_$,
      b.MONTH_END
  FROM bill_aggregated b
  LEFT JOIN srls_monthly sm
    ON sm.subs_subs_id = b.subs_subs_id
    AND sm.srls_srls_id = b.srls_srls_id
    AND sm.month_end = b.MONTH_END
    -- ★ КЛЮЧЕВОЕ ИЗМЕНЕНИЕ: соединяем по пакету ТОЛЬКО если он не ноль
    AND (sm.pack_pack_id = b.PACK_PACK_ID 
         OR (b.PACK_PACK_ID = 0 AND sm.pack_pack_id = 0))
),
```

Блок 5 (bill_final) — возвращаем группировку по пакету:

```sql
bill_final AS (
  SELECT
      clnt_clnt_id,
      subs_subs_id,
      srls_srls_id,
      PACK_PACK_ID,  -- ★ ВОЗВРАЩАЕМ в GROUP BY
      RTPL_RTPL_ID,
      NVL(serv_parm, 0) AS serv_parm,
      SUM(CASE WHEN EXTRACT(MONTH FROM MONTH_END) = 1 THEN AMOUNT_$ ELSE 0 END) AS chrg_01,
      SUM(CASE WHEN EXTRACT(MONTH FROM MONTH_END) = 2 THEN AMOUNT_$ ELSE 0 END) AS chrg_02,
      -- ... (остальные месяцы)
      SUM(CASE WHEN EXTRACT(MONTH FROM MONTH_END) = 12 THEN AMOUNT_$ ELSE 0 END) AS chrg_12
  FROM bill_with_ipu
  GROUP BY clnt_clnt_id, subs_subs_id, srls_srls_id, PACK_PACK_ID, RTPL_RTPL_ID, NVL(serv_parm, 0)
),
```

Блок 10 (финальный LEFT JOIN) — соединяем по полному ключу:

```sql
LEFT JOIN bill_final ch 
  ON ch.CLNT_CLNT_ID = subs.clnt_clnt_id 
  AND ch.subs_subs_id = subs.subs_subs_id 
  AND ch.srls_srls_id = srls.srls_srls_id
  AND ch.PACK_PACK_ID = srls.pack_pack_id  -- ★ Соединяем по пакету
  AND ch.RTPL_RTPL_ID = subs.RTPL_RTPL_ID
  AND NVL(ch.serv_parm, 0) = NVL(srls.serv_parm, 0)
```